        "created_at": "2016-05-31T22:04:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The order I think was legit, though I agree it's open to debate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I think you're right about placing into a hazard space not triggering the hazard, but I've frankly lost track of the rules. Given the fact that the rules are now under discussion, probably best to wait until the version two rules are released.</p>",
