        "raw": "<p>The order I think was legit, though I agree it&#39;s open to debate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I think you&#39;re right about placing into a hazard space not triggering the hazard, but I&#39;ve frankly lost track of the rules. Given the fact that the rules are now under discussion, probably best to wait until the version two rules are released.</p>",
